#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:1
msgid "Flux and intensity"
msgstr "通量与强度"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:3
msgid ""
"This page summarizes two switches that control how PySME outputs "
"synthetic spectra."
msgstr "本页总结了控制 PySME 输出合成光谱方式的两个开关。"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:5
msgid "`normalize_by_continuum`"
msgstr "`normalize_by_continuum`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:7
msgid ""
"`normalize_by_continuum` controls whether the synthetic spectrum is "
"divided by the synthetic continuum:"
msgstr "`normalize_by_continuum` 控制是否用合成连续谱去除合成光谱："

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:10
msgid ""
"`True` (default): output a continuum-normalized spectrum (usually for "
"normalized observations)"
msgstr "`True`（默认）：输出经过连续谱归一化的光谱（通常用于已归一化的观测）"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:11
msgid "`False`: keep flux-level output (usually for flux-calibrated observations)"
msgstr "`False`：保留通量层级输出（通常用于已做通量定标的观测）"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:13
msgid ""
"Even when this is `False`, continuum fitting can still be enabled through"
" `cscale_flag`."
msgstr "即使这里设为 `False`，也仍然可以通过 `cscale_flag` 启用连续谱拟合。"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:16
msgid "`specific_intensities_only`"
msgstr "`specific_intensities_only`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:18
msgid ""
"`specific_intensities_only` controls whether PySME returns angle-"
"dependent specific intensities or disk-integrated flux:"
msgstr "`specific_intensities_only` 控制 PySME 返回的是与角度相关的比强度，还是盘面积分后的通量："

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:21
msgid ""
"`False` (default): integrate specific intensities over the stellar disk "
"and return flux"
msgstr "`False`（默认）：将比强度在恒星盘面上积分，并返回通量"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:22
msgid ""
"`True`: return specific intensities directly, without flux-level post-"
"processing"
msgstr "`True`：直接返回比强度，不进行通量层级的后处理"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:23
msgid ""
"In this mode, `synthesize_spectrum` stores trimmed intensity-level "
"outputs on `sme`:"
msgstr "在这种模式下，`synthesize_spectrum` 会把裁剪后的强度层级输出存入 `sme`："

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:24
msgid "`sme.wint`: transfer wavelength grid per segment"
msgstr "`sme.wint`：每个 segment 的 transfer 波长网格"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:25
msgid "`sme.sint`: line+continuum specific intensities `(nmu, nwave)`"
msgstr "`sme.sint`：谱线+连续谱的比强度 `(nmu, nwave)`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:26
msgid "`sme.cint`: continuum specific intensities `(nmu, nwave)`"
msgstr "`sme.cint`：连续谱比强度 `(nmu, nwave)`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:28
msgid ""
"This is useful when you want the radiative-transfer output itself (as a "
"function of angle), rather than only the final integrated spectrum."
msgstr "当你关心的是辐射转移本身的输出（作为角度的函数），而不仅仅是最终积分后的光谱时，这个模式就很有用。"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:31
msgid "Typical usage"
msgstr "典型用法"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:33
msgid "Normalized stellar spectrum fitting:"
msgstr "归一化恒星光谱拟合："

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:34
msgid "`normalize_by_continuum = True`"
msgstr "`normalize_by_continuum = True`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:35 ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:38
msgid "`specific_intensities_only = False`"
msgstr "`specific_intensities_only = False`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:36
msgid "Flux-calibrated analysis:"
msgstr "通量定标后的分析："

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:37
msgid "`normalize_by_continuum = False`"
msgstr "`normalize_by_continuum = False`"

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:39
msgid "Intensity-level diagnostics / custom integration:"
msgstr "强度层级诊断 / 自定义积分："

#: ../../fundamentals/flux_inten.md:40
msgid "`specific_intensities_only = True`"
msgstr "`specific_intensities_only = True`"
